<title>USA: U.S. STOCKPILE LOANS 119,000 OZ PLATINUM TO MINT.</title>
<headline>U.S. STOCKPILE LOANS 119,000 OZ PLATINUM TO MINT.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center has loaned 119,000 ounces of platinum to the U.S. Mint for coinage operations. The terms of the agreement signed August 5 requires that the material be returned to the Stockpile upon 30 days notice, or in any event no later than 2003, the agency said.</p>
<p>((--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
